# Interview contract

When you change how the student chat infers, probes, defaults, reviews, or uses voice, also update:

- `docs/grok-interview.md` (source of truth for teammates)
- `canvases` interview flow if that canvas is in this workspace

# Copy

Never use em dashes, in code, copy, prompts, or docs. Use a comma, colon, period, or
parentheses. `humanize_reply()` strips them from model output; do not add them back by hand.
Scotty introduces himself as "a Grok powered AI assistant".
